		{"id":"78bb17fa42fa799c","type":"text","text":"### Biomes\n- African Savanna\n- Alpine/ Cold/ Northern\n- Australian Coastal Forests\n- Coastal\n- Deciduous Forest (broadleaves) Eastern Appalachia\n- Department Stores\n- European UK\n- Garden: Country\n- Garden: Japanese\n- Hawaiian Rainforest\n- Office Buildings\n- Small Apartments\n- Southern China\n- Temperate Forest Floor Pack\n- Alpine Shrublands\n- Chaparral\n- Boreal Forests\n- Cultivated\n- Desert/Xeric Shrublands\n- Mangrove/Salt Marsh\n- Marine\n- Mediterranean\n- Savanna/Arid Grasslands\n- Steppes/Grasslands\n- Subtropical Broadleaf Forests\n- Temperate Coniferous Forests\n- Temperate Deciduous Forests\n- Tropical Coniferous Forests\n- Tropical Mixed Forests/Jungle\n- Wetlands","x":2823,"y":-598,"width":537,"height":889},
