		{"id":"5569ded6b4c5c118","type":"text","text":"### Cellular automata\n* Concept: 2D or 3D grid where each cell has state and it is altered per iteration using set of rules.\n* Reading:\n\t* https://natureofcode.com/cellular-automata/\n\t* https://softologyblog.wordpress.com/2018/02/\n\t* https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eyQQkFMCaEE","x":9183,"y":5497,"width":520,"height":280},
		{"id":"1e00859a7abac0f6","type":"text","text":"### Eden model\n* Concept: cluster growth by random accumulation of particles on boundary\n* Reading:\n\t* https://www.researchgate.net/publication/368332707_Topology_and_Local_Geometry_of_the_Eden_Model","x":9182,"y":6160,"width":523,"height":280},
		{"id":"05bcd675ead7d1c9","type":"file","file":"Images/Organic/Tools/ReactionDiffusion2D.jpg","x":9819,"y":4918,"width":739,"height":172},
		{"id":"6ed4865c270cac3e","type":"file","file":"Images/Organic/Tools/CA3D.jpg","x":10657,"y":5433,"width":498,"height":408},
		{"id":"0719720a6c55d16d","type":"file","file":"Images/Organic/Tools/CA2D.jpg","x":9803,"y":5497,"width":744,"height":280},
		{"id":"e1179053bbd0e1f1","type":"text","text":"### Reaction diffusion\n* Concept: set of differential equations describing reactions (transformation of substances) and reaction (spread of substance) resulting in structured patterns.\n* Reading:\n\t* https://entagma.com/houdini-true-3d-reaction-diffusion/\n\t* https://www.karlsims.com/rd.html","x":9196,"y":4846,"width":509,"height":316},
		{"id":"f8eee87bb0745bf3","type":"file","file":"Images/Organic/Tools/ReactionDiffusion.jpg","x":10608,"y":4804,"width":301,"height":400},
		{"id":"62d40467431729bf","type":"text","text":"### Diffusion limited aggregation\n* Concept: clustering particles by random walk/Brownian motion forming aggregates\n* Reading:\n\t* https://paulbourke.net/fractals/dla/","x":9196,"y":4154,"width":509,"height":237},
		{"id":"6a3f9c78e757fdf5","type":"file","file":"Images/Organic/Tools/DLA.jpg","x":9867,"y":4073,"width":400,"height":399},
		{"id":"977dd86a7aa61513","type":"file","file":"Images/Organic/Tools/Eden.jpg","x":9928,"y":6100,"width":382,"height":400},
		{"id":"2f9695b7f751dfc8","type":"file","file":"Images/Organic/Tools/DLA2.jpg","x":10383,"y":4073,"width":458,"height":399},
		{"id":"c906803eaffbbf3d","type":"text","text":"Grid representation (voxels) where each cell can contain:\n* binary scalar for opaque objects\n* float scalar field for describing density values\n* float vector field for describing vector fields","x":10078,"y":7042,"width":515,"height":162},
		{"id":"8887f95c3454e3fb","type":"text","text":"### Differential geometry, differential growth, iteration, recursion\n* Concept: iterative or recursive application of geometrical operators\n* Reading:\n\t* https://procegen.konstantinmagnus.de/simulating-growth-on-meshes\n\t* https://www.behance.net/gallery/21605971/Neri-Oxman-Wanderers\n\t* https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LgAt2FWJ0V0","x":9214,"y":2754,"width":509,"height":380},
		{"id":"78a6873c8b76bcd6","type":"text","text":"## Masks\n* Use mask information over surface (or volume) which is then used to control scale and placement of geometrical instances.\n* Mask can be generated using various methods: noise, distance, curvature, etc.\n* https://siver.artstation.com/blog/YMBD/houdini-blog-9-noise\n* https://www.houdinikitchen.net/2019/05/21/introduction-to-vops/","x":9275,"y":760,"width":509,"height":360},
		{"id":"00398a167710622d","type":"file","file":"Images/Organic/Tools/LSystem2.jpg","x":9868,"y":3408,"width":520,"height":360},
		{"id":"b9fc18ad0a0293c1","type":"file","file":"Images/Organic/Tools/SplineCurve2.jpg","x":10398,"y":2076,"width":469,"height":378},
		{"id":"69bc697866e36a49","type":"file","file":"Images/Organic/Tools/NoiseMask.jpg","x":9865,"y":680,"width":570,"height":520},
		{"id":"e8a1e5369dd7bb35","type":"file","file":"Images/Organic/Tools/pbrt_instancing.jpg","x":9835,"y":-404,"width":559,"height":315},
		{"id":"b0281045e5598a35","type":"text","text":"### Noise fields, rigging and deformation\n* Procedural animation using vector fields, skeleton or deformation cage\n* Reading:\n\t* https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ibe1JBF5i5Y\n\t* https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yHG9QJve1gc","x":9214,"y":1519,"width":509,"height":282},
		{"id":"605bfe926bed1593","type":"file","file":"Images/Organic/Tools/got_animation.jpg","x":9814,"y":1480,"width":643,"height":360},
		{"id":"328d6f6411d083e5","type":"file","file":"Images/Organic/Tools/LSystem1.jpg","x":10468,"y":3388,"width":375,"height":400},
		{"id":"e8f2fc31621a1766","type":"text","text":"### L-system\n* Concept: rewriting grammar and production rules for generating branching structures\n* Reading:\n\t* https://www.sidefx.com/docs/houdini/nodes/sop/lsystem.html\n\t* https://paulbourke.net/fractals/lsys/\n\t* https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8jYNmf1VzsQ&t=66s\n\t* https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CgxTCpUqp5Q\n\t* https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0vE8GiXhOWM","x":9183,"y":3408,"width":600,"height":360},
		{"id":"5d0e3ae1e24df298","type":"file","file":"Images/Organic/Tools/NoiseMaskInstancing.jpg","x":10465,"y":680,"width":574,"height":520},
		{"id":"9dc3c4098eec945e","type":"file","file":"Images/Organic/Tools/bending_anim.jpg","x":10502,"y":1480,"width":417,"height":360},
		{"id":"c4071b87d818a39c","type":"text","text":"### Geometrical instancing\n* Concept: copy 3D models with various transformation properties (position, rotation and scale) and materials\n* Reading:\n\t* https://pbr-book.org/4ed/Primitives_and_Intersection_Acceleration/Primitive_Interface_and_Geometric_Primitives\n\t* https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eshOzshjt90","x":9275,"y":-394,"width":509,"height":305},
		{"id":"9d82911702d671d7","type":"text","text":"### Collisions and proximity\n* Using information on proximity (surface or object) or  collision for guiding growth\n* https://80.lv/articles/tutorial-creating-a-proximity-effect-with-geometry-nodes-in-blender/\n* https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=56jhjLOhvsY&t=75s","x":9275,"y":188,"width":509,"height":240},
